.TH "CSSSTYLEVALUE" "3JS" "August 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSStyleValue \- CSSStyleValue
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]CSSStyleValue\f[B]\f[R] interface of the CSS Typed Object
Model API is the base class of all CSS values accessible through the
Typed OM API.
An instance of this class may be used anywhere a string is expected.
.SH STATIC METHODS
.TP
\f[B]CSSStyleValue.parse()\f[R]
Sets a specific CSS property to the specified values and returns the
first value as a \f[CR]CSSStyleValue\f[R] object.
.TP
\f[B]CSSStyleValue.parseAll()\f[R]
Sets all occurrences of a specific CSS property to the specified value
and returns an array of \f[CR]CSSStyleValue\f[R] objects, each
containing one of the supplied values.
.SH INSTANCE METHODS
.TP
\f[B]CSSStyleValue.toString()\f[R]
A stringifier that returns the value formatted as a string of standard
CSS text.
